{"2679790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Baron", "steam_appid": 2679790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/dec2d1ded7df4706e01db85bbedef17b.avif?t=1777202426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/dec2d1ded7df4706e01db85bbedef17b.avif?t=1777202426 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BARON – The First Realistic Open World Mafia RPG Set in Turkey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the criminal underworld of Ankara, <strong>BARON</strong> places players at the heart of a story about justice, loyalty, and revenge. After losing his parents at a young age, <strong>Alparslan</strong> takes a stand against a corrupt mafia regime to protect his neighborhood and uncover the truth behind his father’s murder. But this is only the beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/49bed2358101f34564fba85942778be0.avif?t=1777202426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/49bed2358101f34564fba85942778be0.avif?t=1777202426 width=800 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 What to Expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ A highly immersive world reflecting Turkish culture and daily life<br>(local street vendors, neighborhood cafés, Atatürk statues, mosques)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Fully voiced Turkish characters with professional dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ A deep, choice-driven story that shapes the future of your world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Level-based character development and skill upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Open-world exploration and dynamic missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Day-night cycle and underground black market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ TPS/FPS gameplay mechanics with cinematic cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/8472ee7c16260bc9e157ecaf0503d706.avif?t=1777202426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/8472ee7c16260bc9e157ecaf0503d706.avif?t=1777202426 width=1170 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 From Backstreets to Crime Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the hustle of Ankara’s streets, echoes of prayer calls from minarets, and authentic local details — <strong>BARON</strong> is more than just an action game; it’s a cultural experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👊 Your Choice: Justice or Power?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The decisions you make won’t only affect Alparslan — they’ll change the entire neighborhood. Will you show mercy or exact revenge? Will you build an empire, or die trying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/d376f8fedc9d67a11ebc78803d733123.avif?t=1777202426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/d376f8fedc9d67a11ebc78803d733123.avif?t=1777202426 width=800 height=384 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/dec2d1ded7df4706e01db85bbedef17b.avif?t=1777202426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/dec2d1ded7df4706e01db85bbedef17b.avif?t=1777202426 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BARON – The First Realistic Open World Mafia RPG Set in Turkey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the criminal underworld of Ankara, <strong>BARON</strong> places players at the heart of a story about justice, loyalty, and revenge. After losing his parents at a young age, <strong>Alparslan</strong> takes a stand against a corrupt mafia regime to protect his neighborhood and uncover the truth behind his father’s murder. But this is only the beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/49bed2358101f34564fba85942778be0.avif?t=1777202426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/49bed2358101f34564fba85942778be0.avif?t=1777202426 width=800 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 What to Expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ A highly immersive world reflecting Turkish culture and daily life<br>(local street vendors, neighborhood cafés, Atatürk statues, mosques)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Fully voiced Turkish characters with professional dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ A deep, choice-driven story that shapes the future of your world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Level-based character development and skill upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Open-world exploration and dynamic missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Day-night cycle and underground black market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ TPS/FPS gameplay mechanics with cinematic cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/8472ee7c16260bc9e157ecaf0503d706.avif?t=1777202426\" data-big-src=https://shared.ak